OL,3,AIsraeli strike on hospital kills at
OL,4,Aleast five Palestinians, Gaza civil
OL,5,Adefence agency says
OL,6,
OL,7,FA surgeon is reported to be among those
OL,8,Fwho were killed during the strike early
OL,9,Fon Thursday.
OL,11,FThe Israeli military says it struck a
OL,12,Fsenior Hamas member and other militants
OL,13,Fwho were using the hospital "as a
OL,14,Fcommand center for military and
OL,15,Fterrorist activities".
